ss=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/b4dbd5765d7d6f327509f332965fb3d375e4323b382b18b30444ed599cf1152d.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
